Falsifies `designware_ethernet::proofs::a_transmit_descriptor_keeps_its_length_inside_its_fields`.

The defect: the transmit descriptor no longer masks the frame length to its 15 bits, so a length with bit 15 set lands on the error summary flag of word 3.

Expected to fail: the harness's check that word 3 holds nothing outside the length, owned, first and last fields, on any length with bit 15 set.

